cases.correct_diagnosis:
1. fsutil file queryfileid D:\work 返回 0x0 → 证实投影断裂
2. 列出重解析点: Get-ChildItem D:\ -Force | Where-Object {$_.Attributes -match 'ReparsePoint'}
3. 重建junction: New-Item -ItemType Junction -Path D:\work -Target E:\actual-work -Force

流式大文件处理:
$reader = [System.IO.StreamReader]::new('file.txt')
while ($null -ne ($line = $reader.ReadLine())) {
    if ($line -match 'error') { Write-Output $line }
}
$reader.Close()
或使用: Get-Content file.txt -ReadCount 1000 | ForEach-Object { ... } （批量读取）

PowerShell 5.1的等价写法:
if (command1) { command2 } else { command3 }
或:
$result = command1; if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) { command2 } else { command3 }
